  "naming_txt": "Receipts\n========\n\nFile every receipt under Finance/<year>/<MM>-<Month>/, for example\nFinance/2026/02-February/. Create the month folder if it is not there yet.\n\nName each receipt <YYYY-MM-DD>_<vendor>.pdf: the receipt date, an underscore,\nthen the vendor in lower case with words joined by hyphens and no other\npunctuation (Linden & Park becomes linden-park, Brightwater Foods becomes\nbrightwater-foods).\n\nIf a receipt's file name carries no date, use the file's modified date.\n\nA paid invoice is a receipt for this purpose. File it the same way, by the\ndate in its name.\n\nPrice lists, quotes, statements and anything that is not a receipt are not\nfiled here and stay where they are.\n",
